## Running Tests

Run tests with:

```bash
env \
  -u MYTEAM_AGENT_SESSION_NONCE \
  -u MYTEAM_AGENT_SESSION_RESULT_SOCKET \
  -u MYTEAM_SUPERVISOR_SOCKET \
  -u MYTEAM_WORKFLOW_INVOCATION_ID \
  uv run pytest
```

The `MYTEAM_*` variables must be removed because this development session may itself be running inside a managed workflow. If inherited by test subprocesses, they can be mistaken for nested workflow processes and produce failures such as `Nested workflow parent is not the current hierarchy entry.` Apply the same prefix when running a subset of the suite.
